nie może mieć kontaktu z owocem .</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c3 c17 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:72pt; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; padding-left:0''><span class=\"c1\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Opakowanie jednostkowe z produktem  paletyzować zgodnie z zaleceniem .</span></li></ul><p align=\"left\" class=\"c10 c62\" style=''margin:0; color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt''><span class=\"c14\" style=''-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none; color:#000; font-weight:700; text-decoration:underline; vertical-align:baseline; text-decoration-skip-ink:none; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Zasyp na podestach </span></p><ul class=\"c5 lst-kix_list_16-0 start\" style=\"padding:0; margin:0; list-style-type:none\"><li align=\"left\" class=\"c0 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:36pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left''><span class=\"c1\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Dbanie o swoje bezpieczeństwo  poprzez używanie środków ochrony indywidualnej – szelek oraz urządzenia samohamownego.</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c0 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:36pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left''><span class=\"c1\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decorat