><p align=\"justify\" class=\"c15\" style=''margin:0; color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:justify''><span class=\"c21\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:700; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Etapy mycia maszynowego opakowań – myjka do beczek</span></p><ul class=\"c5 lst-kix_list_20-0 start\" style=\"padding:0; margin:0; list-style-type:none\"><li align=\"justify\" class=\"c15 c17 c22 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:justify; padding-left:0; margin-left:72pt''><span class=\"c1\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">usunięcie resztek owoców</span></li><li align=\"justify\" class=\"c15 c17 c22 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:justify; padding-left:0; margin-left:72pt''><span class=\"c1\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">mycie wstępne karcherem </span></li><li align=\"justify\" class=\"c15 c17 c22 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:justify; padding-left:0; margin-left:72pt''><span class=\"c1\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">mycie i dezynfekcja w myjce do beczek </span></li><li align=\"justify\" class=\"c15 c17 c22 li-bu