ft''><span class=\"c4\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:700; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">For men:</span></p><ol class=\"c29 lst-kix_list_15-0 start\" start=\"1\" style=\"margin:0; padding:0; list-style-type:none; counter-reset:lst-ctn-kix_list_15-0 0\"><li align=\"left\" class=\"c22 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:90pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; counter-increment:lst-ctn-kix_list_15-0''><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">30 kg - </span><span class=\"c75\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:12pt; font-family:\"Calibri\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\"> </span><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">during permanent work,</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c22 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:90pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; counter-increment:lst-ctn-kix_list_15-0''><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\"> 50 kg - </span><span class=\"c75\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:12pt; font-family:\"Calibri\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\"> </span><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">during occasional work.</span></li></ol><p align=\"left\" class=\"c47\" style=''margin:0; color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:72pt; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left''><span class=\"c4\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:700; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Для женщин:</span></p><p align=\"left\" class=\"c64\" style=''margin:0; color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left''><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">                                a)   12 kg - </span><span class=\"c75\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:12pt; font-family:\"Calibri\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\"> </span><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">during permanent work,</span></p><p align=\"left\" class=\"c64 c57\" style=''margin:0; color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt''><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">                  b)   20 kg - </span><span class=\"c75\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:12pt; font-family:\"Calibri\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\"> </span><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">during occasional work.</span></p><ul class=\"c29 lst-kix_list_13-0 start\" style=\"padding:0; margin:0; list-style-type:none\"><li align=\"left\" class=\"c13 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:72pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left''><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Before use, packaging must be checked for technical and hygienic condition (damaged or dirty packaging should be disposed of).</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c13 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:72pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left''><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Small fruit packaging containers should be stored on dedicated platforms; the number of prepared packages must not exceed 10 pieces.</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c13 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:72pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left''><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Large containers (octabins, SPK) should be stacked according to the instructions of supervising personnel; damaged containers should be disposed of.</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c13 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:72pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left''><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Immediately before filling the packaging with fruit, check its hygienic and technical condition (cleanliness, absence of foreign objects).</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c13 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:72pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left''><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Each fruit package must be weighed according to established unit weights.</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c13 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:72pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left''><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">When closing cartons, ensure that the PE bag tightly protects the product and that the carton does not come into direct contact with the fruit.</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c13 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:72pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left''><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Product packages should be palletized according to recommendations.</span></li></ul><p align=\"left\" class=\"c12 c57\" style=''margin:0; color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt''><span class=\"c60\" style=''-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none; color:#000; font-weight:700; text-decoration:underline; vertical-align:baseline; text-decoration-skip-ink:none; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Loading on platforms: </span></p><ul class=\"c29 lst-kix_list_16-0 start\" style=\"padding:0; margin:0; list-style-type:none\"><li align=\"left\" class=\"c0 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:36pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left''><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Ensure personal safety by using personal protective equipment — safety harnesses and self-retracting fall arrest devices.</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c0 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:36pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left''><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Ensure the safety of co-workers working on platforms by closing safety barriers and following the rule: the employee performing loading gives way to a passing worker from the inner side of the loading area.</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c58 c57 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt''><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Regular feeding of fruit onto the production line should be carried out according to the pulsator or instructions from the supervising person.</span></li></ul><p align=\"left\" class=\"c64 c57\" style=''margin:0; color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt''><span class=\"c4\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:700; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">In the following situations, loading must be stopped and reported to the supervisor:</span></p><ul class=\"c29 lst-kix_list_16-0\" style=\"padding:0; margin:0; list-style-type:none\"><li align=\"left\" class=\"c0 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:36pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left''><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">severe contamination of fresh fruit — sand, soil, as well as significant contamination of frozen fruit in cartons or other packaging;</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c0 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:36pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left''><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">mixed fruit in crates, cartons, or other packaging;</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c58 c57 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt''><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">periodic cleaning of machines and equipment.</span></li></ul><p align=\"left\" class=\"c12 c57\" style=''margin:0; color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt''><span class=\"c60\" style=''-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none; color:#000; font-weight:700; text-decoration:underline; vertical-align:baseline; text-decoration-skip-ink:none; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Unloading work:</span></p><ul class=\"c29 lst-kix_list_14-0 start\" style=\"padding:0; margin:0; list-style-type:none\"><li align=\"left\" class=\"c0 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:36pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left''><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Ensure personal safety and the safety of co-workers; pay special attention to incoming delivery vehicles and forklift trucks.</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c0 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:36pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left''><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Fruit unloading should be carried out according to the supervisor’s instructions.</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c0 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:36pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left''><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">In the event of heavily contaminated fruit in crates, report it to the quality control personnel.</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c0 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:36pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left''><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Segregation of packaging according to type, quality, and instructions of the supervising person.</span></li></ul><p align=\"left\" class=\"c12 c57\" style=''margin:0; color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt''><span class=\"c60\" style=''-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none; color:#000; font-weight:700; text-decoration:underline; vertical-align:baseline; text-decoration-skip-ink:none; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Ad.2 </span></p><p align=\"left\" class=\"c12\" style=''margin:0; color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left''><span class=\"c4\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:700; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Manual washing and cleaning of lids, rings, and buckets:</span></p><ul class=\"c29 lst-kix_list_18-0 start\" style=\"padding:0; margin:0; list-style-type:none\"><li align=\"justify\" class=\"c3 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:72pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:justify''><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">effective manual washing and cleaning of packaging using brushes and chemical solutions prepared by washing and disinfection employees;</span></li><li align=\"justify\" class=\"c3 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:72pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:justify''><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">rinsing packaging in two consecutive water tanks;</span></li><li align=\"justify\" class=\"c3 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:72pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:justify''><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">storage in transport packaging;</span></li><li align=\"justify\" class=\"c3 li-bulle