t-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:72pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:justify''><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">insufficiently cleaned or heavily contaminated crates should be returned for additional manual cleaning and then reintroduced into the mechanical washer;</span></li><li align=\"justify\" class=\"c3 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:72pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:justify''><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">damaged crates should be sorted and placed on a separate pallet;</span></li><li align=\"justify\" class=\"c3 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:72pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:justify''><span class=\"c7\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">wooden pallets for crates must be complete and undamaged; in exceptional situations palletizing on plastic pallets is permitted.  </span></li></ul><p align=\"justify\" class=\"c37\" style=''margin:0; color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:justify''><span class=\"c4\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:700; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Stages of machine washing of packa