pan class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Manual loading/unloading and carrying of loads in accordance with logistics requirements, not exceeding:</span></li></ul><p align=\"left\" class=\"c1 c46\" style=''margin:0; color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">For men:<br/>a) 30 kg - during regular work,<br/>b) 50 kg - during occasional work</span></p><p align=\"left\" class=\"c1 c46\" style=''margin:0; color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">For women:</span></p><ol class=\"c25 lst-kix_list_23-0 start\" start=\"1\" style=\"margin:0; padding:0; list-style-type:none; counter-reset:lst-ctn-kix_list_23-0 0\"><li align=\"left\" class=\"c1 c89 li-bullet-1\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:54pt; padding-left:-5pt; counter-increment:lst-ctn-kix_list_23-0''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">12 kg - during regular work,</span></li></ol><p align=\"left\" class=\"c1 c46\" style=''margin:0; color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">b)  20 kg - during occasional work</span></p><ul class=\"c25 lst-kix_list_16-0\" style=\"padding:0; margin:0; list-style-type:none\"><li align=\"left\" class=\"c18 c5 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt; padding-left:0''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Replacing protective gloves when damaged or worn out.</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c18 c5 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt; padding-left:0''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Maintaining order at the workstation.</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c18 c5 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt; padding-left:0''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Proper performance of assigned tasks according to the supervisor’s instructions.</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c18 c5 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt; padding-left:0''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Ensuring high-quality finished products through proper removal of all contaminants.</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c18 c5 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt; padding-left:0''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Ensuring product safety by sorting products or materials according to defects specified in the specification and separating defective products.</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c18 c5 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt; padding-left:0''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Packaging assortments according to the supervisor’s instructions.</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c18 c5 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt; padding-left:0''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Accuracy and efficiency in performing tasks.</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c18 c5 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt; padding-left:0''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Manual sorting of fruit into: organic waste, sorted-out fruit, and foreign objects.</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c1 c5 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt; padding-left:0''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Maintaining cleanliness in assigned work areas (cleaning, sweeping, washing).</span></li></ul><p align=\"left\" class=\"c1 c46 c15\" height=\"10pt\" style=''margin:0; color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt; height:10pt''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\"></span></p><p align=\"left\" class=\"c1\" style=''margin:0; color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left''><span class=\"c27\" style=''-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none; color:#000; font-weight:700; text-decoration:underline; vertical-align:baseline; text-decoration-skip-ink:none; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Packaging and preparation of packaging:</span></p><ul class=\"c25 lst-kix_list_17-0 start\" style=\"padding:0; margin:0; list-style-type:none\"><li align=\"left\" class=\"c18 c5 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt; padding-left:0''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Before starting work, remove unnecessary items from the workstation that may pose a potential risk to the product (used tape rolls, used protective gloves, plastic film).</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c18 c5 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt; padding-left:0''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Before using packaging, inspect its technical and hygienic condition (damaged or dirty packaging should be discarded).</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c18 c5 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt; padding-left:0''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Small fruit packaging containers should be stored on dedicated platforms; the number of prepared packages must not exceed 10 pieces.</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c5 c18 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt; padding-left:0''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Immediately before filling packaging with fruit, check its hygienic and technical condition (clean, free from foreign objects).</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c18 c5 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt; padding-left:0''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Each package containing fruit must be weighed according to the established unit weight standards.</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c18 c5 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1.079167; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt; padding-left:0''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">When closing cartons, ensure that the PE bag tightly protects the product and that the carton does not come into direct contact with the fruit.</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c1 c5 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt; padding-left:0''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Maintain order at the workstation.</span></li></ul><p align=\"left\" class=\"c1 c46\" style=''margin:0; color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt''><span class=\"c27\" style=''-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none; color:#000; font-weight:700; text-decoration:underline; vertical-align:baseline; text-decoration-skip-ink:none; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Ad.2 </span></p><p align=\"left\" class=\"c1\" style=''margin:0; color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left''><span class=\"c12\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:700; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Manual washing and cleaning of lids, rings, and buckets:</span></p><ul class=\"c25 lst-kix_list_18-0 start\" style=\"padding:0; margin:0; list-style-type:none\"><li align=\"justify\" class=\"c6 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:72pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:justify''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Effective manual washing and cleaning of packaging using brushes and cleaning solutions prepared by washing and disinfection personnel.</span></li><li align=\"justify\" class=\"c6 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:72pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:justify''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Rinsing packaging in two consecutive water tanks.</span></li><li align=\"justify\" class=\"c6 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:72pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:justify''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Storing packaging in transport containers.</span></li><li align=\"justify\" class=\"c6 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:72pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:justify''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Using personal protective equipment.</span></li></ul><p align=\"justify\" class=\"c24\" style=''margin:0; color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:justify''><span class=\"c12\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:700; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Stages of machine washing of packaging – crate washer:</span></p><ul class=\"c25 lst-kix_list_19-0 start\" style=\"padding:0; margin:0; list-style-type:none\"><li align=\"justify\" class=\"c24 c35 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:justify; margin-left:74.2pt; padding-left:0''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Removal of fruit residues.</span></li><li align=\"justify\" class=\"c24 c35 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:justify; margin-left:74.2pt; padding-left:0''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Feeding crates into the washer at the appropriate frequency.</span></li><li align=\"justify\" class=\"c24 c35 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:justify; margin-left:74.2pt; padding-left:0''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Insufficiently cleaned or heavily contaminated crates must be returned for manual cleaning and then reintroduced into the mechanical washer.</span></li><li align=\"justify\" class=\"c24 c35 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:justify; margin-left:74.2pt; padding-left:0''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Damaged crates must be sorted and placed on a separate pallet.</span></li><li align=\"justify\" class=\"c24 c35 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:justify; margin-left:74.2pt; padding-left:0''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Wooden pallets for crates must be complete and undamaged; in exceptional situations, palletizing on plastic pallets is permitted.  </span></li></ul><p align=\"justify\" class=\"c24\" style=''margin:0; color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:justify''><span class=\"c12\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:700; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Stages of machine washing of packaging – barrel washer:</span></p><ul class=\"c25 lst-kix_list_20-0 start\" style=\"padding:0; margin:0; list-style-type:none\"><li align=\"justify\" class=\"c6 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:72pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:justify''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Removal of fruit residues.</span></li><li align=\"justify\" class=\"c6 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:72pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:justify''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Preliminary washing using a Karcher pressure washer.</span></li><li align=\"justify\" class=\"c6 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:72pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:justify''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Washing and disinfection in the barrel washer.</span></li><li align=\"justify\" class=\"c6 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:72pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:justify''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Before palletizing, visually inspect the cleanliness of the packaging; packaging that does not meet the required standard must be returned for Karcher washing or manual cleaning.</span></li><li align=\"justify\" class=\"c6 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:72pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:justify''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Palletizing on plastic pallets; the first barrels on the pallet should be covered with lids, while the remaining barrels should be nested one inside another or vice versa depending on the pallet type.</span></li><li align=\"justify\" class=\"c6 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; margin-left:72pt; padding-top:0; padding-left:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:justify''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Maximum palletizing capacity is approximately 6 barrels × 4 units.</span></li></ul></td></tr><tr class=\"c92\" height=\"43.9pt\" style=\"height:43.9pt\"><td class=\"c30\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"padding:0 3.5pt 0 3.5pt; border-right-style:solid; border-bottom-color:#000; border-top-width:1pt; border-right-width:1pt; border-left-color:#000; vertical-align:middle; border-right-color:#000; border-left-width:1.5pt; border-top-style:solid; border-left-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; width:31.9pt; border-top-color:#000; border-bottom-style:solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"31.9pt\"><p align=\"left\" class=\"c1\" style=''margin:0; color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left''><span class=\"c16\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">VII.</span></p></td><td class=\"c65\" colspan=\"6\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"padding:0 3.5pt 0 3.5pt; border-right-style:solid; border-bottom-color:#000; border-top-width:1pt; border-right-width:1.5pt; border-left-color:#000; vertical-align:middle; border-right-color:#000; border-left-width:1pt; border-top-style:solid; border-left-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1pt; width:482pt; border-top-color:#000; border-bottom-style:solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"482pt\"><p align=\"left\" class=\"c1\" style=''margin:0; color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left''><span class=\"c12\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:700; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Scope of authority: </span></p><ul class=\"c25 lst-kix_list_2-0 start\" style=\"padding:0; margin:0; list-style-type:none\"><li align=\"left\" class=\"c1 c5 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt; padding-left:0''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">The right to submit suggestions to the supervisor aimed at improving work quality.</span></li></ul><ul class=\"c25 lst-kix_list_4-0 start\" style=\"padding:0; margin:0; list-style-type:none\"><li align=\"left\" class=\"c1 c5 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt; padding-left:0''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">The right to operate machinery and equipment according to their intended purpose.</span></li><li align=\"left\" class=\"c1 c5 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt; padding-left:0''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">The right to stop the conveyor belt if foreign objects, especially glass, are found and immediately report the incident to the supervisor.</span></li></ul><ul class=\"c25 lst-kix_list_2-0\" style=\"padding:0; margin:0; list-style-type:none\"><li align=\"left\" class=\"c1 c5 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left; margin-left:36pt; padding-left:0''><span class=\"c9\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">The right to stop work if it poses a risk to employee safety or product safety.</span></li></ul></td></tr><tr class=\"c71\" height=\"35.2pt\" style=\"height:35.2pt\"><td class=\"c17\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"padding:0 3.5pt 0 3.5pt; border-right-style:solid; border-bottom-color:#000; border-top-width:1pt; border-right-width:1pt; border-left-color:#000; vertical-align:middle; border-right-color:#000; border-left-width:1.5pt; border-top-style:solid; border-left-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1.5pt; width:31.9pt; border-top-color:#000; border-bottom-style:solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"31.9pt\"><p align=\"left\" class=\"c1\" style=''margin:0; color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left''><span class=\"c16\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:400; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">VIII.</span></p></td><td class=\"c93\" colspan=\"6\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"padding:0 3.5pt 0 3.5pt; border-right-style:solid; border-bottom-color:#000; border-top-width:1pt; border-right-width:1.5pt; border-left-color:#000; vertical-align:middle; border-right-color:#000; border-left-width:1pt; border-top-style:solid; border-left-style:solid; border-bottom-width:1.5pt; width:482pt; border-top-color:#000; border-bottom-style:solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"482pt\"><p align=\"left\" class=\"c1\" style=''margin:0; color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0; line-height:1; orphans:2; widows:2; text-align:left''><span class=\"c12\" style=''color:#000; font-weight:700; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; font-size:9pt; font-family:\"Arial\"; font-style:normal'' valign=\"baseline\">Scope of responsibility: </span></p><ul class=\"c25 lst-kix_list_5-0 start\" style=\"padding:0; margin:0; list-style-type:none\"><li align=\"left\" class=\"c1 c5 li-bullet-0\" style=''color:#000; font-size:10pt; font-family:\"Times