ransform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px); -webkit-transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px);\" title=\"\" /></span></p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"c21\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"c30\"><span class=\"c26\">SCOPE OF DUTIES RESULTING FROM THE QUALITY SYSTEM REQUIREMENTS</span></p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"c11\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"c2 c17\"><span class=\"c1\">Number:</span></p>\n<p class=\"c30 c17\"><span class=\"c25\">FJ/SJ/KAD/14</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"c13\">\n<td class=\"c21\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"c30\"><span class=\"c24\">Employees of Andros-Polska</span></p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"c11\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"c2 c17\"><span class=\"c18\">Page 1</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"c13\">\n<td class=\"c5\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"c2\"><span class=\"c18\">Date of issue: 17.04.2009</span></p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"c8\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"c2\"><span class=\"c18\">Replaces: 01.02.2008; FJ/SJ/KAD/14; W1</span></p>\n<p class=\"c31\"><span class=\"c18\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"c9\">(issue date ; number ; version)</span></p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"c22\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"c2 c17\"><span class=\"c18\">&nbsp;Version: W2</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p class=\"c6\"><span class=\"c0\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"c7\"><span class=\"c3\">Employees at all levels of the ANDROS-POLSKA organization are obliged to:</span></p>\n<ul class=\"c32 lst-kix_list_19-0\">\n<li class=\"c15 li-bullet-0\"><span class=\"c3\">initiate actions preventing the occurrence of any non-conformities of the product, process, and QUALITY SYSTEM with established requirements;</span></li>\n<li class=\"c15 li-bullet-0\"><span class=\"c3\">identify and document all problems concerning the product, process, and QUALITY SYSTEM in accordance with established procedures;</span></li>\n<li class=\"c15 li-bullet-0\"><span class=\"c3\">initiate, propose, or provide solutions to problems related to the product, process, and QUALITY SYSTEM;</span></li>\n<li class=\"c15 li-bullet-0\"><span class=\"c3\">verify implemented solutions;</span></li>\n<li class=\"c15 li-bullet-0\"><span class=\"c3\">supervise further processing, delivery, or installation of products that do not meet requirements until the non-conformities are eliminated.</span></li>\n<li class=\"c15 li-bullet-0\"><span class=\"c23\">ensure proper hygienic and sanitary conditions within the plant in accordance with GHP, GMP, and the adopted ANDROS-POLSKA standards.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"c6\"><span class=\"c0\"></span></p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-family: ''Times New Roman'', serif; font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 30px;\">\n<p style=\"text-decoration: underline; margin-bottom: 5px;\">I declare that the content of this scope of duties, authorizations and responsibilities is known to me.</p>\n<p style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">I undertake to comply with its provisions. I confirm receipt of 1 copy.</p>\n</div>\n<table style=\"width: 100%; table-layout: fixed; border-collapse: collapse; border: 0; margin-top: 40px; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;\">Data: {%Data dzisiejsza%}</div>\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Imię i Nazwisko: {%Imię%} {%Nazwisko%}</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; vertical-align: bottom;\">\n<div style=\"width: 240px; margin: 0 auto; float: right;\">\n<div style=\"width: 210px; height: 70px; margin: 0 auto 5px auto; border: 1px dashed #ccc; background-color: #fafafa; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\">{%Podpis odręczny pracownika%}</div>\n<div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #000; padding-top: 5px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold;\">(Podpis / Signature)</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p class=\"c6\"><sp